What happens next
-----------------

- Store data fixes are written through Shopify's Admin API. Rampsmith then
  re-scans the affected pages to verify them.
- Code fixes go to your developer as a pull request. Rampsmith verifies them
  after it is merged.

The remediation log records who approved each fix, and when.

